[50.19558, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll inspect the workspace and available Python/ML environment first, then fetch the model metadata so the label configuration and adapter are handled \r\ncorrectly.\r\n\r\n```\r\npwd && ls -la && echo '---' && python -V && pip --version && echo '---' && df -h /app /tmp 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\npython - <<'PY'\r\nimport importlib.util\r\nfor m in ['torch','transformers','peft','safetensors','huggingface_hub','sentencepiece']:\r\n    s=importlib.util.find_spec(m)\r\n    print(m, bool(s))\r\n    if s:\r\n        mod=__import__(m)\r\n        print(' ', getattr(mod,'__version__','?'))\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[50.195829, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
