[52.575791, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe workspace is empty and the ML stack is not installed. I’ll check hardware and network access, then install a compatible CPU/GPU PyTorch stack plus \r\nTransformers and PEFT.\r\n\r\n```\r\nnvidia-smi 2>&1 | head -40 || true; echo '---'; python -c 'import platform; print(platform.machine(), platform.platform())'\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\ncurl -I -L --max-time 20 https://huggingface.co/FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base 2>&1 | head -20\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
