[93.021489, "o", "\r\u001b[2KCPU-only Torch is downloading now. While it installs, I’ll inspect the public adapter repository and base model configuration files via the Hugging Face API.\r\n\r\n```\r\nfor i in $(seq 1 20); do if ! kill -0 \"$(cat /app/pip_torch.pid)\" 2>/dev/null; then echo DONE; break; fi; sleep 2; done; tail -30 /app/pip_torch.log\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\npython - <<'PY'\r\nimport json, urllib.request\r\nfor repo in ['FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base','dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection']:\r\n    print('===',repo)\r\n    for f in ['config.json','adapter_config.json']:\r\n        url=f'https://huggingface.co/{repo}/resolve/main/{f}'\r\n        try:\r\n            with urllib.request.urlopen(url, timeout=20) as r:\r\n                data=r.read().decode()\r\n            print('---',f); print(data[:5000])\r\n        except Exception as e: print(f,'ERR',e)\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
