[126.644289, "o", "\r\u001b[2KNow I’ll download the base model and LoRA adapter into local directories. This is a large model download, so I’ll run it in the background and monitor progress.\r\n\r\n```\r\nmkdir -p /app/downloads/base /app/downloads/adapter /app/model_cache /app/merged_model\r\ncat > /app/download_models.py <<'PY'\r\nfrom huggingface_hub import snapshot_download\r\nimport os, time\r\nprint('Downloading base...', flush=True)\r\nsnapshot_download(\r\n    repo_id='FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base',\r\n    local_dir='/app/downloads/base',\r\n)\r\nprint('Base done', flush=True)\r\nprint('Downloading adapter...', flush=True)\r\nsnapshot_download(\r\n    repo_id='dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection',\r\n    local_dir='/app/downloads/adapter',\r\n)\r\nprint('Adapter done', flush=True)\r\nPY\r\ncd /app && nohup python /app/download_models.py > /app/download.log 2>&1 & echo $! > /app/download.pid; sleep 5; tail -30 /app/download.log\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
