[183.893306, "o", "\r\u001b[2KBoth models are downloaded. Before building, I’ll inspect the adapter checkpoint keys to confirm that the 20-class classifier is included and will override the \r\nrandomly initialized base classifier.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nimport torch\r\np='/app/downloads/adapter/adapter_model.bin'\r\nsd=torch.load(p,map_location='cpu',weights_only=True)\r\nfor k,v in sd.items():\r\n    print(k, tuple(v.shape), v.dtype)\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
