[238.84279, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m15\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[238.843668, "o", "\r\u001b[2KArtifacts are present, but Transformers 5 serialized `num_labels` as `null` while retaining a full 20-entry `id2label` mapping. I’ll verify that the reloaded \r\nconfig reports 20 labels and compare reloaded merged-model logits against a freshly adapter-applied model for consistency.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncat > /app/validate.py <<'PY'\r\nimport json\r\nimport torch\r\nfrom transformers import AutoConfig, AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForSequenceClassification\r\nfrom peft import PeftModel\r\n\r\nfor p in ['/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base','/app/merged_model']:\r\n    cfg=AutoConfig.from_pretrained(p)\r\n    print(p, 'num_labels=',cfg.num_labels, 'id2label_len=',len(cfg.id2label), 'arch=',cfg.architectures)\r\n\r\ntexts=[\r\n    \"Bonjour, comment allez-vous aujourd'hui?\",\r\n    \"Hola, ¿cómo estás hoy?\",\r\n    \"Guten Tag, wie geht es Ihnen?\",\r\n    \"Ciao, come stai oggi?\",\r\n    \"Olá, como você está?\",\r\n    \"Привет, как дела?\",\r\n    \"こんにちは、お元気ですか？\",\r\n    \"你好，你好吗？\",\r\n    \"مرحبا، كيف "]
[238.843694, "o", "حالك؟\",\r\n    \"Hello, how are you?\",\r\n]\r\n\r\ntok=AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained('/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base')\r\nbase=AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained('/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base')\r\nadapter=PeftModel.from_pretrained(base,'/app/downloads/adapter').eval()\r\nmerged=AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained('/app/merged_model').eval()\r\nprint('model num_labels:', adapter.config.num_labels, merged.config.num_labels)\r\nprint('classifier out:', adapter.base_model.model.classifier.out_proj.out_features, merged.classifier.out_proj.out_features)\r\n\r\nall_ok=True\r\nwith torch.inference_mode():\r\n    for text in texts:\r\n        inputs=tok(text,return_tensors='pt',truncation=True,max_length=512)\r\n        la=adapter(**inputs).logits\r\n        lm=merged(**inputs).logits\r\n        same=torch.allclose(la,lm,atol=1e-5,rtol=1e-4)\r\n        same_arg=int(la.argmax(-1)) == int(lm.argmax(-1))\r\n        maxdiff=float((la-lm).abs().max())\r\n        print('same_logits=',same,'same_argmax=',same_arg,'maxdiff"]
[238.843702, "o", "=',maxdiff,'adapter_argmax=',int(la.argmax(-1)))\r\n        all_ok = all_ok and same and same_arg\r\nprint('ALL_OK', all_ok)\r\nassert all_ok\r\nPY\r\ncd /app && nohup python /app/validate.py > /app/validate.log 2>&1 & echo $! > /app/validate.pid; sleep 5; tail -20 /app/validate.log\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
