[283.648647, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m17\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[283.650028, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe merged model reloads correctly and produces logits matching the adapter-applied model within floating-point tolerance. I’ll make the saved configs \r\nexplicitly report `num_labels: 20` and include the SentencePiece tokenizer asset so both fast and slow tokenizer loading paths are robust.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho '--- tokenizer_config'; cat /app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base/tokenizer_config.json; echo; echo '--- ensure spm + explicit num_labels'; python - <<'PY'\r\nimport json, shutil, os\r\nfor d in ['/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base','/app/merged_model']:\r\n    cfg_path=os.path.join(d,'config.json')\r\n    with open(cfg_path,encoding='utf-8') as f: cfg=json.load(f)\r\n    cfg['num_labels']=20\r\n    with open(cfg_path,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f: json.dump(cfg,f,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\r\n    spm_src='/app/downloads/base/sentencepiece.bpe.model'\r\n    shutil.copy2(spm_src,os.path.join(d,'sentencepiece.bpe.model'))\r\n    print(d, 'num_labels=',cfg['num_labels'], 'spm copied', os.path.getsize(os.path.join(d,'sentencepiece"]
[283.6502, "o", ".bpe.model')))\r\nPY\r\necho '--- files'; find /app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base -maxdepth 1 -type f -printf '%f %s\\n' | sort; find /app/merged_model -maxdepth 1 -type f -printf '%f \r\n%s\\n' | sort\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[283.650209, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[283.673133, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[283.673565, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n--- tokenizer_config\r\n{\r\n  \"add_prefix_space\": true,\r\n  \"backend\": \"tokenizers\",\r\n  \"bos_token\": \"<s>\",\r\n  \"cls_token\": \"<s>\",\r\n  \"eos_token\": \"</s>\",\r\n  \"is_local\": true,\r\n  \"local_files_only\": false,\r\n  \"mask_token\": \"<mask>\",\r\n  \"model_max_length\": 512,\r\n  \"pad_token\": \"<pad>\",\r\n  \"sep_token\": \"</s>\",\r\n  \"tokenizer_class\": \"XLMRobertaTokenizer\",\r\n  \"unk_token\": \"<unk>\"\r\n}\r\n\r\n--- ensure spm + explicit num_labels\r\n/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base num_labels= 20 spm copied 5069051\r\n/app/merged_model num_labels= 20 spm copied 5069051\r\n--- files\r\nconfig.json 1621\r\nmodel.safetensors 1112260376\r\nsentencepiece.bpe.model 5069051\r\ntokenizer.json 17098086\r\ntokenizer_config.json 342\r\nconfig.json 1621\r\nmodel.safetensors 1112260376\r\nsentencepiece.bpe.model 5069051\r\ntokenizer.json 17098086\r\ntokenizer_config.json 342\r\n\r\n"]
[283.674809, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[283.674874, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
