[291.670986, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m18\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[291.672364, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll now run a broader 20-language smoke test against the saved merged model, compare predictions to the adapter’s published label mapping for validation only, \r\nand confirm the detection results file still matches the model output.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncat > /app/final_validate.py <<'PY'\r\nimport json, torch\r\nfrom collections import defaultdict\r\nfrom transformers import AutoConfig, AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForSequenceClassification, XLMRobertaTokenizer\r\n\r\nbase_path='/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base'\r\nmerged_path='/app/merged_model'\r\nfor p in (base_path,merged_path):\r\n    raw=json.load(open(p+'/config.json',encoding='utf-8'))\r\n    cfg=AutoConfig.from_pretrained(p)\r\n    print(p,'raw_num_labels',raw.get('num_labels'),'config_num_labels',cfg.num_labels,'id2label_len',len(cfg.id2label))\r\n    assert raw.get('num_labels')==20 and cfg.num_labels==20 and len(cfg.id2label)==20\r\n\r\nfast=AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(base_path)\r\nslow=XLMRobertaTokenizer.from_pretrained(base_path)\r\nassert fast('Hello, how are you?')['input_ids"]
[291.672427, "o", "']==slow('Hello, how are you?')['input_ids']\r\nprint('Fast/slow tokenizer parity OK')\r\n\r\n# Published adapter mapping, used only to validate that adapter weights landed correctly.\r\nadapter_cfg=json.load(open('/app/downloads/adapter/config.json',encoding='utf-8'))\r\nlabel2id=adapter_cfg['label2id']\r\ntests={\r\n 'ar':'مرحبا، كيف حالك؟',\r\n 'bg':'Здравей, как си?',\r\n 'de':'Guten Tag, wie geht es Ihnen?',\r\n 'el':'Γεια σου, τι κάνεις;',\r\n 'en':'Hello, how are you?',\r\n 'es':'Hola, ¿cómo estás hoy?',\r\n 'fr':'Bonjour, comment allez-vous aujourd’hui ?',\r\n 'hi':'नमस्ते, आप कैसे हैं?',\r\n 'it':'Ciao, come stai oggi?',\r\n 'ja':'こんにちは、お元気ですか？',\r\n 'nl':'Hallo, hoe gaat het met je?',\r\n 'pl':'Cześć, jak się masz?',\r\n 'pt':'Olá, como você está?',\r\n 'ru':'Привет, как дела?',\r\n 'sw':'Habari, unaendeleaje?',\r\n 'th':'สวัสดี สบายดีไหม',\r\n 'tr':'Merhaba, nasılsın?',\r\n 'ur':'ہیلو، آپ"]
[291.672461, "o", " کیسے ہیں؟',\r\n 'vi':'Xin chào, bạn khỏe không?',\r\n 'zh':'你好，你好吗？',\r\n}\r\nmodel=AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(merged_path).eval()\r\ncorrect=0\r\nper=defaultdict(list)\r\nwith torch.inference_mode():\r\n    for lang,text in tests.items():\r\n        inputs=fast(text,return_tensors='pt',truncation=True,max_length=512)\r\n        logits=model(**inputs).logits\r\n        pid=int(logits.argmax(-1))\r\n        ok=pid==label2id[lang]\r\n        correct+=ok; per[lang].append(ok)\r\n        print(f'{lang}: pred={pid} expected={label2id[lang]} ok={ok} conf={torch.softmax(logits,-1).max().item():.4f}')\r\nprint('accuracy',correct,'/',len(tests))\r\nassert correct==len(tests)\r\n\r\n# Confirm recorded results correspond to a fresh merged-model pass.\r\nsaved=json.load(open('/app/detection_results.json',encoding='utf-8'))\r\nwith torch.inference_mode():\r\n    for row in saved:\r\n        inputs=fast(row['text'],return_tensors='pt',truncation=True,max_length=512)\r\n        logits=model(**inputs).logits\r\n        "]
[291.672486, "o", "assert int(logits.argmax(-1))==row['predicted_class_id']\r\n        conf=float(torch.softmax(logits,-1).max())\r\n        assert abs(conf-row['confidence'])<1e-5\r\nprint('detection_results.json consistency OK')\r\nprint('ALL_FINAL_VALIDATIONS_PASSED')\r\nPY\r\ncd /app && nohup python /app/final_validate.py > /app/final_validate.log 2>&1 & echo $! > /app/final_validate.pid; sleep 5; tail -20 /app/final_validate.log\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
